              "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nNo active review issues are recorded for this documentation-only clarification of bilingual coverage and publication limitations.\n\n**No open issues** 🎉\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nUpdates the internationalization documentation to distinguish the historical foundation from the current bilingual public-site candidate. This is documentation-only and does not approve publication.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Documents partial Spanish coverage across 45 public routes, including 11 `noindex` publication-status notices.\n- Clarifies English fallbacks and account, billing, notification, and consent flows not yet qualified as bilingual.\n- Records local validation results at the referenced commit, while noting that they do not establish translation quality or hosted, end-to-end behavior.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| docs/​I18N_FOUNDATION.md | Adds current bilingual coverage, readiness limitations, and local validation evidence while preserving the historical baseline. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>",
