              "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nNo active review issues block the change excluding scratch directories from the TypeScript program.\n\n**No open issues** 🎉\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nThis PR excludes ignored scratch directories from the TypeScript program to prevent unrelated nested-worktree sources from increasing typecheck memory use.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Adds `tmp` and `temp` exclusions while preserving application, test, and generated Next.js route types.\n- Documents the root cause, reported build and typecheck validation, and local resource measurements.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `tsconfig.json` | Excludes the `tmp` and `temp` scratch trees. |\r\n| `docs/​product/​TYPESCRIPT-BUILD-QUALIFICATION.md` | Records the diagnosis, validation evidence, and local build/typecheck measurements. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>",
