              "id": "PRR_kwDOSak6YM8AAAABWB2r0g",
              "state": "COMMENTED",
              "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nWorkload requests can trigger external relay execution on ALLOW, violating the decision-only boundary, while authentication and API-contract defects can reject valid requests.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>5 open issues</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.png\" alt=\"High severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Disable external relay execution for workload decisions](https://github.com/emeaexecutive/Cyber-Sentinels-V2/pull/130#discussion_r4471351318) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Exclude workload JWTs from Supabase recovery verification](https://github.com/emeaexecutive/Cyber-Sentinels-V2/pull/130#discussion_r4471351406) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Limit idempotency headers to the supported key length](https://github.com/emeaexecutive/Cyber-Sentinels-V2/pull/130#discussion_r4471351477) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Use a workload-specific decision request schema](https://github.com/emeaexecutive/Cyber-Sentinels-V2/pull/130#discussion_r4471351542) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Filter revoked bindings before requiring a single active match](https://github.com/emeaexecutive/Cyber-Sentinels-V2/pull/130#discussion_r4471351629) · New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nAdds tenant-bound OIDC workload authentication to the public API, connecting registered machine identities to the existing canonical trust-decision flow. Hosted qualification remains gated on approved issuer configuration and database-backed isolation tests.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Adds pinned token verification and owner/admin workload-binding management.\n- Introduces a workload-authenticated decision route with shared rate limiting and auditing.\n- Extends API contracts, SDK and PowerShell clients, documentation, and focused tests.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `tests/​workload-identity.test.mjs` | Tests token validation, binding contracts, and migration restrictions. |\r\n| `tests/​external-agent-client-parity.test.mjs` | Adds workload endpoints to client parity checks. |\r\n| `tests/​cyber-sentinels-sdk.test.mjs` | Tests separation of API-key and workload credentials. |\r\n| `supabase/​migrations/​20261104150000_workload_identity_bindings.sql` | Adds tenant-bound, service-role-only workload registrations. |\r\n| `packages/​cyber-sentinels-sdk/​src/​index.ts` | Adds binding methods and workload decision requests. |\r\n| `packages/​cyber-sentinels-sdk/​README.md` | Documents workload authentication usage. |\r\n| `package.json` | Adds `jose` as a production dependency. |\r\n| `package-lock.json` | Updates the dependency lock accordingly. |\r\n| `lib/​public-api/​v1/​workload-token.ts` | Verifies tokens against pinned issuer, audience, and JWKS configuration. |\r\n| `lib/​public-api/​v1/​workload-identity.ts` | Resolves workload bindings and current owner access. |\r\n| `lib/​public-api/​v1/​workload-bindings.ts` | Implements registration, listing, and revocation. |\r\n| `lib/​public-api/​v1/​openapi.ts` | Documents workload endpoints and authentication. |\r\n| `lib/​public-api/​v1/​handler.ts` | Shares request handling across authentication types. |\r\n| `lib/​public-api/​v1/​contracts.ts` | Adds workload routes and error codes. |\r\n| `examples/​powershell/​agent-gamma.ps1` | Adds workload management and decision helpers. |\r\n| `docs/​tenente/​WORKLOAD-IDENTITY-PR-A.md` | Defines security boundaries and qualification gates. |\r\n| `app/​developers/​quickstart/​page.tsx` | Adds workload onboarding examples and endpoint listings. |\r\n| `app/​api/​v1/​workloads/​[agentId]/​decisions/​route.ts` | Derives agent identity from workload authentication before requesting decisions. |\r\n| `app/​api/​v1/​agents/​[agentId]/​workload-bindings/​route.ts` | Exposes binding listing and registration. |\r\n| `app/​api/​v1/​agents/​[agentId]/​workload-bindings/​[bindingId]/​revoke/​route.ts` | Exposes binding revocation. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>",
